# Pier posts under tile_jetty (solid): the post continues down through
# the lake (flat T / b / B bands as tile_wolfgangsee_water_deep, no
# streaks), darker below the middle. Post position follows tile_jetty
# (end posts at open ends), so autotile it the same way.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
# Only the left/right bits change the look.
sprite = tile_jetty_post
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
